512
00:44:13,245 --> 00:44:15,785
net  earnings,  or  net  loss.

513
00:44:16,525 --> 00:44:20,005
This  is  because  income  can
be  positive  or  negative.

514
00:44:21,425 --> 00:44:29,805
The  EPS  pattern  looks  for  earnings
per  share,  diluted  share  or  EPS.

515
00:44:30,805 --> 00:44:36,005
It  captures  the  decimal  number
after  optional  dollar  sign.

516
00:44:37,245 --> 00:44:41,205
The  margin  pattern  looks
for  operating  margin,  gross

517
00:44:41,205 --> 00:44:42,765
margin  or  net  margin.

518
00:44:43,665 --> 00:44:45,765
It  captures  the  percentage  number.

519
00:44:46,765 --> 00:44:49,265
These  patterns  aren't  perfect.

520
00:44:50,485 --> 00:44:54,885
They'll  catch  false  positives
sometimes,  but  for  a  first

521
00:44:54,885 --> 00:44:56,405
