416
00:39:58,934 --> 00:40:02,354
We  use  a  sliding  window
approach  with  an  overlap.

417
00:40:02,874 --> 00:40:06,594
This  ensures  that  important
information  near  chunk

418
00:40:06,594 --> 00:40:08,414
boundaries  are  preserved.

419
00:40:09,714 --> 00:40:12,774
The  overlap  is  50  tokens  by  default.

420
00:40:12,774 --> 00:40:19,414
This  means  that  each  token,
each  chunk  shares  50  tokens  with

421
00:40:19,414 --> 00:40:21,214
the  previous  and  next  chunks.

422
00:40:22,179 --> 00:40:24,489
This  improves  retrieval  quality.

423
00:40:25,409 --> 00:40:28,689
The  chunk  size  is
512  tokens  by  default.

424
00:40:29,589 --> 00:40:33,329
This  is  the  optimal  size
for  text  embedding  3small.

425
00:40:33,749 --> 00:40:36,129
It  balances  context  and  cost.

